+- [ ] **REC-008**: When a submission's base_revision does not match the current head revision, the system SHALL reject the submission and return the current head revision with its full fields.
+- [ ] **REC-009**: When multiple accepted revisions share the same base_revision, the system SHALL mark the visit as having unresolved review work and include all competing revisions in the retrieval response.
+- [ ] **REC-010**: When a coordinator resolves competing revisions by selecting one, the system SHALL create a new revision with the selected revision's fields, record the coordinator as author, and link the contributing revision IDs.
+- [ ] **REC-011**: When a coordinator resolves competing revisions by providing merged_fields, the system SHALL create a new revision with the provided fields, record the coordinator as author, and link the contributing revision IDs.
